#: ../../source/libraries/data/queue_world.md:3
msgid ""
"`QueueWorld` visualizes a FIFO queue as a row of boxes growing left-to-"
"right. The front box (next to be dequeued) is highlighted in red; the "
"back box (most recently enqueued) in purple."
msgstr ""

